class Solution {
    /**
     * Returns the total number of collisions between two sets of cars.
     *
     * Each of the n cars moving left-to-right will collide exactly once with
     * each of the n cars moving right-to-left, regardless of their initial
     * positions, because all cars travel at the same speed on an infinite line.
